<!--
  Copy this to CLAUDE.md on your own machine. CLAUDE.md itself is gitignored: it is the
  LOAD layer, and what a machine loads is that machine's business.

      cp CLAUDE.md.example CLAUDE.md

  The line below is the only thing every machine needs — it pulls in the shared law.
  Everything you add under it is yours: your agent tooling, your local procedures, the
  roles this particular machine plays. None of it should ever end up in AGENTS.md, and
  none of it costs anyone else a single token to read.

  AGENTS.md is the shared half. If a rule belongs to every dev on every machine, it goes
  there. If it only works where your tools are installed, it goes here.
-->

@AGENTS.md
